            "action_name": {
              "value": "Exemplar Of Violence"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(visual)\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe graveknight attempts a Strike as their armor flashes with sinister power that spurs allies to violence. After the Strike, allies who can see the graveknight can use a reaction to Step or Stride, but they must end this movement in a space adjacent to an enemy. One ally of the graveknight's choice can instead use a reaction to Strike."
            },
